        },
        {
          "text": "Elija wamjibu yuya mkpwulu wa anajeshi mirongo mitsano, “Ichikala ni kpweli mimi ni mutu wa Mlungu, moho nautserere kula mlunguni na ukuoche uwe phamwenga na anajeshio mirongo mitsano!” Mara mwenga moho watserera kula mlunguni, uchimuocha phamwenga na anajeshie mirongo mitsano.",
          "type": "text",
