              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume wamuhuma mkpwulu wanjina wa anajeshi mirongo mitsano na nyo anajeshie akamrehe Elija. Naye wamuambira Elija; “We mutu wa Mlungu, mfalume anakuamba uteremuke mara mwenga!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.11",
