              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elija wamjibu achiamba, “Ichikala ni kpweli mimi ni mutu wa Mlungu, moho nautserere kula mlunguni na kukuocha uwe phamwenga na anajeshio mirongo mitsano!” Mara mwenga moho wa Mlungu watserera kula mlunguni, uchimuocha phamwenga na anajeshie mirongo mitsano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.12",
