            "sid": "2KI 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kano yanjina tsona, mfalume wahuma mkpwulu wanjina wa anajeshi mirongo mitsano na nyo anajeshie. Mkpwulu wa hahu waambuka mwango, achichita mavwindi mbere za Elija na achimvoya achiamba, “We mutu wa Mlungu, ninavoya utivye maisha gangu na maisha ga hinya ahendadzi-kazio mirongo mitsano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akulu airi arionitanguliya na anajeshi ao, aphya na moho uriotserera kula mlunguni, ela sambi ninakuvoya utivye maisha gangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
